# Trivy allowlist. Every entry MUST carry an expiry date (EXPIRY: YYYY-MM-DD) and
# a justification. CI fails on HIGH/CRITICAL findings except IDs listed here.
# Expired entries are dead: remove the CVE line once past EXPIRY or extend the
# date with a new justification in the security review log.
#
# Format: one CVE per line, comment above with EXPIRY + reason.
# Example:
# # EXPIRY: 2026-12-31 - CVE-2026-12345 in base image, no fixed build yet; tracked in #42.
# CVE-2026-12345
